ntent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aren’t sampled again."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","kind":"